	(text "The plot bed board's touch line (open\ncollector, sheet Plot bed board): its pull-up here at the\nMelzi. endstop_pin: ^PA4 (or this 10k), no !.\nHigh = triggered."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 281.94 175.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3645ba8a-3280-4819-8207-282a13272959")
	)
	(text "+12V (switched) to +7V5_ZK: the Z and K\ndrivers only (VMOT Z/K above)."
