		)
		(uuid "5c23a16d-c971-4a87-8696-b09e42034a27")
	)
	(text "Ports as on the PCB, not as Klipper names them:\nE = stepper_x (A), Y = stepper_y (B), X = stepper_z (Z),\nZ = manual_stepper axis_k (K, the key lock). Z and K on\nthe toolhead. The Z port is built for two motors in\nseries: one motor closes the loop across both headers."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 254 88.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7a6b6af7-aa30-4f97-bf80-26917c949165")
	)
	(text "Endstops ^!PC2 / ^!PC3 / ^!PC4: pull-up, inverted.\nY and Z are on the toolhead (sheet Toolhead)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 71.12 134.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bb5876b0-e1be-4439-98be-1d1296aec3e4")
	)
	(text "USB: the FT232R; VBUS not connected\n(the Melzi runs from its own 12 V)."
